{"id":"74ad5f56-bde1-44b1-96e8-f3403717a663","object":"chat.completion","created":1795243556,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"SELECT c.customer_state,\n       ROUND(SUM(oi.price) / NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT c.customer_unique_id), 0), 2) AS avg_product_amount_per_person\nFROM orders o\nJOIN customers c ON c.customer_id = o.customer_id\nJOIN order_items oi ON oi.order_id = o.order_id\nGROUP BY c.customer_state\nLIMIT 100;","reasoning_content":"我们需要回答 SQL。需要理解问题。需要统计：按订单对应客户档案所在州，统计有商品明细的下单自然人的人均商品金额，不含运费，全部订单状态；同人在各州分别去重。\n\n需要表：orders, customers, order_items. 过滤有商品明细：订单存在 order_items 或通过 join order_items 自然存在。订单对应客户档案所在州：customers.customer_state 沿 orders.customer_id -> customers.customer_id。按州分组。指标：人均商品金额，不含运费，= 每个州商品金额总和 / 该州有商品明细的下单自然人数（去重 customer_unique_id）。全部订单状态不过滤 order_status。同人在各州分别去重：每个州内 count distinct customer_unique_id。金额：SUM(oi.price)，但连接多明细和客户一对多? customers customer_id primary so one. orders one customer. order_items multiple; sum price correct per item. Need avoid duplicate from multiple orders? join orders->order_items fine. For amount denominator natural persons who placed orders with product details. Need in each state, distinct customer_unique_id among orders that have items. Numerator total product amount for all orders with details in state. Same person in multiple states counts in each state; within state dedup. Good.\n\nNeed be careful NULL customer_unique_id: policy default only known identity for people count. But order amount? The question asks 有商品明细的下单自然人的人均商品金额. Natural person identity via customer_unique_id. Should count distinct known identities? Could also include NULL? The rule: 人数和按人分组时不把SQL NULL身份合并成一个人；默认只统计已知身份，用户明确未知可单列. Here count distinct excludes null automatically and no separate unknown. But amount numerator should include all product amount for orders with details in state? If calculating per-person average over known identities, denominator known people, numerator sum amou